  "sn17.33:1.1": "sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … tatra kho bhagavā … ",
  "sn17.33:1.2": "dāruṇo bhikkhave lābhasakkārasiloko …pe… ",
  "sn17.33:1.3": "lābhasakkārasilokena abhibhūtassa pariyādinnacittassa bhikkhave devadattassa kusalo dhammo samuccheda magamā. ",
  "sn17.33:1.4": "evaṃ dāruṇo kho bhikkhave lābhasakkārasiloko …pe… ",
  "sn17.33:1.5": "sikkhitabbanti. ",
  "sn17.33:1.6": "tatiyaṃ. "
}
